2. ARTWORK: ALL RIGHTS RESERVED
================================================================================

"Muteki Artwork" means the original composite design created by Muteki,
consisting of:

  (a) the hexagonal arrangement of six connected nodes and the lines joining
      them;
  (b) the selection, arrangement and placement of the surrounding elements
      around that hexagon, and their relation to the nodes;
  (c) the visual styling of the nodes, lines and overall composition; and
  (d) every file embodying the above, including logo.png and project.png, and
      any source, vector, resized, recolored or otherwise converted version.

The Muteki Artwork is NOT licensed under the MIT License or under any other
